  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_AdministrativeLitigationForRevocationOfTheDispositionOnBidParticipationRestrictionEtcRelatedToTheCollusiveConductInKepcos170KvGisProjectSeoulAdministrativeCourtCaseNo2025Guhap54809OfPlaintiffInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">한전은 2025. 7. 17. 공공기관운영법 등에 근거하여 2025. 7. 25.부터 2026. 1. 24까지 6개월 동안 당사의 입찰참가자격을 제한하고, 170kV GIS 유자격자등록을 취소하는 처분을 함</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity01205851_CanadianLargeTransformerAntiDumpingNvr101102104120AppealCanadianInternationalTradeTribunalMemberOfPlaintiffInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2020년 ~ 2021년 당사가 캐나다로 수출한 변압기 반덩핑 관세 일부에 대해 국제무역재판소(CITT)에 항소를 제기</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
